{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794172766,"nonce":"yz/O7asbg69jdsZipSqjqjrgW/0=","title":"L3 — Repositories screen backed by the real workspace","message":"## Context\n`App` (`src/main.rs:48`) holds only theme and section; the top bar's Repositories pill (`src/ui/screen.rs:44`) does nothing.\n\n## Files\n- `src/main.rs:48` `App`, `:67` `Message`, `:74` `update` — workspace, repos, per-repo issues, async loading\n- `src/ui/screen.rs` — new Repositories page; sidebar header shows the workspace, not one repo\n\n## Approach\n- `cargo add rfd` for the folder picker.\n- Boot: load `Workspace` (L2), `discover`, then `gitbug::list` per repo through `Task::perform` (blocking work inside; iced's default `thread-pool` executor), batched one task per repo so a slow or locked repo never blocks the rest.\n- Per-repo status: `Ok(n)`, `NoGitBug`, `Locked`, `Error(msg)` — shown with `components::dot` (`src/ui/components.rs:75`) and `Tone`.\n- Page: roots list (Add project, Add folder to scan, Remove), discovered repos with status + issue counts, Rescan. Persist every change; persist the theme toggle (`dark`).\n- Leave the mock Epics page as is (L5 replaces it).\n\n## Depends on\nL2 — `Workspace`, `discover`\n\n## Out of scope\n- Issue browsing (L4), writes.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Unit test: feeding `update` repo-loaded messages fills per-repo status/issues; a `Locked` result does not drop other repos\n- Manual: adding a folder via the picker persists to `workspace.json` and survives restart\n- All three gates pass","files":null}]}